{
  "name": "dsh-piliaurora-wall",
  "version": "0.2.2",
  "description": "PiliAurora 视频墙：侧边栏一键搜索 B 站视频，并行打开 N 个独立播放窗口并自动网格排列；支持一键开关声音、全部隐藏/显示、切换下一批视频与自动连播。全程不抢鼠标、不显示额外界面（窗口先在屏幕外创建再搬运）。内置依赖自检与设置页：自动探测 PiliAurora 程序/服务脚本/Python，缺依赖可一键拉起，路径可手动指定。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "scripts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "locale/*.json"
  ],
  "icon": "./icon.svg",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "piliaurora",
    "bilibili",
    "video-wall",
    "multi-window",
    "grid"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "loyalchiiina",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-piliaurora-wall.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-piliaurora-wall#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-piliaurora-wall/issues"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [],
      "platform": "web"
    },
    "manifestVersion": 1
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0",
    "dsh": ">=0.2.2-0 <0.3.0"
  }
}